			],
			"Message": "docs(Sky): Add park emoji to ecosystem header and normalize page comments\n\nUpdate the Sky README with minor visual and formatting improvements: add the park emoji (🏞️) to the \"Sky in the Land Ecosystem\" section header for enhanced visual context, and normalize the page route comments to remove redundant \"A1:\" and \"A3:\" prefixes for cleaner documentation.",
